          automatics: [ { name: "4-Speed Automatic (GM 4L30-E)", torqueLimit: "300 Nm", oilType: "Dexron III", note: "A traditional, torque-converter 4-speed automatic supplied by General Motors. It is heavily outdated by modern standards, saps significant power from the small engine, and feels very sluggish, but it is mechanically highly reliable if the fluid and filter are changed every 80k km." } ]
