        sisterModels: [ { name: "BMW 320i (E90)", note: "The extremely popular E90 320i utilized the exact same N46B20 engine. The immense DIY knowledge base regarding timing chain replacement, valve stem seal jobs, and vacuum pump rebuilds on the E90 translates perfectly to this Z4." } ],
