          { name: "O2 Pilot Mod (CCV Upgrade)", description: "Routing a vacuum line from the CCV system to a specific port on the intake manifold to increase crankcase vacuum.", benefit: "Significantly reduces the infamous M54 oil consumption issue caused by the low-tension piston rings." }
